  "content": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2GB3QhtXb4I\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n這個模組最初由 SonicJumper 創作（原始討論串可於<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/wip-mods/1442984-1-6-2-enhanced-visuals-v0-3-deprecated-updated-8\">此處</a>找到）。\n\nEnhancedVisuals 透過在 HUD 上加入特效，提供更身歷其境的遊戲體驗。\n\n**Optifine**\n若要與 Optifine 同時使用 EnhancedVisuals，必須關閉快速渲染、各向異性過濾以及反鋸齒功能，否則當特定效果啟動時，畫面將會變成黑色。\n\n**資源包**\nnox_cgt 製作的 Pixelated v1.3 EnhancedVisuals <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/9tc2q813jrtoj20/Pixelated_v1.3_EnhancedVisuals%20by%20nox_cgt.zip?dl=1\">下載</a>\n\n**ToughAsNails 與 SimpleDifficulty 的附加元件**\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syjOViAN-N4\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n正在尋找能與朋友一同遊玩的伺服器嗎？我們的贊助商已為您準備妥當：\n\n[<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png \" width=\"250\">\n](https://bisecthosting.com/teamcreative)\n\n使用促銷代碼 teamcreative，即可在任一款遊戲伺服器的首月享有 25% 折扣！\n\n[<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" width=\"250\">](https://www.patreon.com/creativemd)",
